message: If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the following
  metadata.
title: 'pmwDPR: A Python Package for Spatiotemporal Collocation of Passive Microwave
  and Dual-Frequency Precipitation Radar Observations'
type: software
authors:
- given-names: Buddha
  family-names: Subedi
  affiliation: University of Minnesota
abstract: An open-source Python package for automated downloading, spatiotemporal
  collocation, and visualization of satellite passive microwave brightness temperatures
  and GPM Dual-Frequency Precipitation Radar observations.
url: https://pypi.org/project/pmwDPR/
keywords:
- Passive microwave
- Dual-Frequency Precipitation Radar
- GPM
- Satellite remote sensing
- Precipitation
- Spatiotemporal collocation
- Precipitation retrieval
- Machine learning
- Python
